<title>TAIWAN: Yang Ming March sales down 23 pct.</title>
<headline>Yang Ming March sales down 23 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Yang Ming Marine Corp said on Wednesday its March sales were T$2.23 billion, down 23 percent from T$2.89 billion from March 1996.</p>
<p>But Yang Ming's combined July 1996-March 1997 sales were T$24.46 billion, up a scant six percent from T$23.07 billion a year earlier, a company statement said.</p>
<p>It did not give profit figures.</p>
<p>Yang Ming is one of Taiwan's biggest shipping firms.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
